  "Description": {
    "Cost": 1369832,
    "UIName": "Wolverine",
    "Id": "chassisdef_wolverine_WVR-6R_renata",
    "Name": "Wolverine",
    "Details": "The 'Renata' has some interesting upgrades over a stock Wolverine WVR-6R, it replaces both the generic autocannon and the medium laser with a more advanced versions, and uses Ferro-Fibrous armor to increase the amount of armor plating the 'Mech can carry. The FCS and sensors of the 'Mech have also been upgraded with improved aftermarket models.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Communications</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_wolverine"
  },
  "VariantName": "WVR-6R-R",
  "ChassisTags": {
    "items": [
      "UniqueMech"
    ]
  },
  "StockRole": "Skirmisher & Cavalry",
  "YangsThoughts": "This customized Wolverine WVR-6R was originally commissioned by Major Miraslova Renata during the SLDF expeditionary force's Operation Smother during the Davion Succession war. However, when Major Renata answered the call of Kerensky and joined the Exodus, the 'Mech was abandoned in a Star League mint on Nouveau Toulouse. The Wolverine was eventually found there by Lawrence Helmund Nelson, who claimed it as his personal 'Mech from that point forwards. ",
